<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Tadiran estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Tadiran estimates cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it cut 1997 and 1998 profit estimates on Tuesday for Tadiran Telecommunications after it reported lower than expected first quarter earnings on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Q1 1997 earnings per share of $0.20 compared with $0.60 last year, below Lehman estimate of $0.28.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Tim Luke said in a report that revenues were in line but earnings were hurt by higher than expected operating expenses.</p>
